(2232: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: Unexecuted%20source%20draft.%20Ordinary%20immutable%20scalar%20vector%20result%20contracts%20compose%20across%20the%20complete%20owned%20source%20module.%20Finite%20returning%20traces%20reach%20an%20actual%20constructor%3B%20recursive%20cycles%20supply%20no%20returning%20value%20by%20themselves.%20Every%20source%20body%20must%20still%20discharge%20its%20result%20postcondition%20before%20a%20valid%20complete%20program%20is%20returned.%20Contracts%20are%20source%20admission%20premises%2C%20not%20observations%20or%20semantic%20equivalence%20proofs.%20Local%20names%20clear%20call%20freshness.%20Named%20vector%20moves%20and%20returned%20parameters%20now%20use%20tracked%20consumption%3B%20string%2Fproduct%20elements%2C%20partial-return%20carriers%2C%20external%2Fcallable%20result%20interfaces%2C%20mutation%2C%20generic%2Ftrait%20ownership%20and%20borrowed%20outlives%20remain%20obligations.%20The%20complete%20preceding%20fixture%20and%20assertions%20are%20retained%3B%20the%20obsolete%20call-tail%20throw%20input%20gets%20explicit%20same-input%20positive%20controls.) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
